            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1084/jem.20171925</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this issue of JEM, Swanson et al. (https://doi.org/10.1084/jem.20171749) report an unanticipated role for cGAMP in priming and activation of inflammasomes in addition to its well-characterized function as an endogenous second messenger inducing type I interferons in the cytosolic DNA-sensing pathway.</AbstractText>
